    <part xml:id="part-lc-hl-introduction">
      <title>Leaving Cert Higher Level Maths Introduction</title>
      <chapter xml:id="lc-hl-introduction"><title>Continuing to Higher Level</title>
        <p>Higher Level builds upon Ordinary Level. Return to the earlier chapters whenever you need to revise a concept or practise a technique. Higher Level students are expected to achieve the Ordinary Level outcomes as well as the additional Higher Level outcomes.</p>
        <p>Explore the <url href="https://www.curriculumonline.ie/senior-cycle/senior-cycle-subjects/mathematics/" visual="official Leaving Certificate Mathematics syllabus"/>. The Higher Level teaching material in this part of the book is being developed strand by strand.</p>
        <p>Begin with <xref ref="lc-hl-calculus"/> or choose a strand from the contents.</p>
      </chapter>
    </part>

    <part xml:id="part-lc-hl-statistics">
      <title>LC HL · Statistics and Probability</title>
      <chapter xml:id="lc-hl-statistics-introduction"><title>Extending Statistics and Probability</title>
        <p>Extend your work on probability and data to more advanced models and statistical inference.</p>
        <p>Revise <xref ref="part-lc-ol-statistics"/> as needed. Higher Level teaching chapters for this strand are in development.</p>
      </chapter>
    </part>

    <part xml:id="part-lc-hl-geometry">
      <title>LC HL · Geometry and Trigonometry</title>
      <chapter xml:id="lc-hl-geometry-introduction"><title>Extending Geometry and Trigonometry</title>
        <p>Build on Ordinary Level geometry and trigonometry with further proofs, relationships and applications.</p>
        <p>Revise <xref ref="part-lc-ol-geometry"/> as needed. Higher Level teaching chapters for this strand are in development.</p>
      </chapter>
    </part>

    <part xml:id="part-lc-hl-number">
      <title>LC HL · Number</title>
      <chapter xml:id="lc-hl-number-introduction"><title>Extending Number</title>
        <p>Develop the Ordinary Level number topics further, including complex numbers, sequences and series.</p>
        <p>Revise <xref ref="part-lc-ol-number"/> as needed. Higher Level teaching chapters for this strand are in development.</p>
      </chapter>
    </part>

